  "bio": "A blind Basran client of Bunanah and a reliable transmitter from Anas; Shu'bah preferred him in Anas even to Qatadah. He and his father had been slaves, and the judge Iyas ibn Mu'awiyah accepted his sole testimony. In hadith 15 he is the Successor of the first chain, and his wording of the hadith (“than his family and his wealth”, in Muslim and Ibn Khuzaymah) differs from Qatadah's.",
